{"schema":"mao-cross-channel-public-site-data/1","script":"0270","rows":[{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0270:000001b5:text","row":36744,"ordinal":1,"kind":"text","jp":"数時間後、俺は帰宅した。","en":"Several hours later, I returned home.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:901499","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4011:00001","en":"A number of hours later, I returned home.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0270:000001e5:text","row":36745,"ordinal":2,"kind":"text","jp":"自宅前には、友貴からの差し入れが置いてあった。","en":"A care package from Tomoki sat outside my door.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:901500","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4011:00002","en":"A supply drop from Tomoki had been left in front of the house.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0270:00000233:text","row":36746,"ordinal":3,"kind":"text","jp":"「……」","en":"“...”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:901501","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4011:00003","en":"Taichi: \"...\"","verdict":"cannot_adjudicate","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0270:000002d6:text","row":36747,"ordinal":4,"kind":"text","jp":"曜子ちゃんを火葬にした。","en":"I cremated Youko.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:901502","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4011:00004","en":"I decided to cremate Youko-chan.","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["tense_aspect","logical_relation"],"assessment":"The Japanese reports the cremation as a completed action. The English reports only a decision to cremate, leaving whether it happened unresolved despite the following burial.","remedy":"I cremated Youko-chan.","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":32,"start":0,"text":"I decided to cremate Youko-chan."}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0270:000002ff:text","row":36748,"ordinal":5,"kind":"text","jp":"腐敗しないのであれば、そうするしかなかった。","en":"If her body wasn't going to decay, there was no other choice.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:901503","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4011:00005","en":"If there's no decay, that's the only alternative.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0270:0000033c:text","row":36749,"ordinal":6,"kind":"text","jp":"そして、埋めた。","en":"Then I buried her.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:901504","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4011:00006","en":"And then, I buried her.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0270:0000035d:text","row":36750,"ordinal":7,"kind":"text","jp":"墓は用意しなかった。","en":"I gave her no grave.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:901505","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4011:00007","en":"I did not place a gravestone,","verdict":"questionable","categories":["undertranslation","word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0270:00000382:text","row":36751,"ordinal":8,"kind":"text","jp":"死は無だからだ。","en":"Death was nothingness.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:901506","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4011:00008","en":"because death was nothing.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0270:000003a3:text","row":36752,"ordinal":9,"kind":"text","jp":"立場が逆だったら、彼女はどうしただろう。","en":"What would she have done if our places had been reversed?","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:901507","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4011:00009","en":"What would she have done, if our positions\nhad been reversed?","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0270:000003dc:text","row":36753,"ordinal":10,"kind":"text","jp":"俺が誰かに殺されてしまったら。","en":"If someone had murdered me.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:901508","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4011:00010","en":"If I had been killed by someone?","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0270:00000467:text","row":36754,"ordinal":11,"kind":"text","jp":"「……」","en":"“...”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:901509","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4011:00011","en":"Taichi: \"...\"","verdict":"cannot_adjudicate","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0270:00000487:text","row":36755,"ordinal":12,"kind":"text","jp":"犯人を捜し出して、殺害するに決まっていた。","en":"She would have hunted down whoever did it and killed them. Of course she would.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:901510","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4011:00012","en":"Search and locate the culprit, then murder, that was obvious.","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["grammar","omission"],"assessment":"The Japanese says she would certainly find the culprit and kill them. The English leaves 'murder' without its required object and does not form a grammatical prediction about her action.","remedy":"She would obviously hunt down the culprit and kill them.","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":61,"start":0,"text":"Search and locate the culprit, then murder, that was obvious."}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0270:000004c9:text","row":36756,"ordinal":13,"kind":"text","jp":"皆殺しにするかも知れない。","en":"She might have killed everyone.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:901511","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4011:00013","en":"Perhaps even commit a massacre, what do I know.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0270:000004fb:text","row":36757,"ordinal":14,"kind":"text","jp":"けど……俺は彼女のために、そこまではしてやれない。","en":"But... I couldn't go that far for her.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:901512","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4011:00014","en":"However... I will not go that far for her sake.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0270:00000545:text","row":36758,"ordinal":15,"kind":"text","jp":"俺が目指すものは……復讐鬼じゃないからだ。","en":"Vengeance wasn't what I was striving for.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:901513","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4011:00015","en":"Because my objective is... not to be a demon possessed by revenge.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0270:00000587:text","row":36759,"ordinal":16,"kind":"text","jp":"心はまだざわめいている。","en":"My heart still wouldn't settle.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:901514","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4011:00016","en":"My heart was still noisily astir.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0270:000005b7:text","row":36760,"ordinal":17,"kind":"text","jp":"そう、日記を書こう。","en":"Right. Time to write in my diary.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:901515","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4011:00017","en":"So I go write the diary.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0270:000005e3:text","row":36761,"ordinal":18,"kind":"text","jp":"書面に。","en":"Put it on paper.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:901516","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4011:00018","en":"While writing,","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["mistranslation","logical_relation"],"assessment":"The Japanese fragment continues the decision to write a diary with the idea of putting the feelings down in writing. 'While writing' instead introduces a simultaneous action that is not present.","remedy":"Put it down in writing.","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":14,"start":0,"text":"While writing,"}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0270:00000610:text","row":36762,"ordinal":19,"kind":"text","jp":"「ん？」","en":"“Hm?”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:901517","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4011:00019","en":"Taichi: \"Hm?\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0270:00000630:text","row":36763,"ordinal":20,"kind":"text","jp":"外から物音。","en":"A sound from outside.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:901518","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4011:00020","en":"Sounds from the outside.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0270:00000700:text","row":36764,"ordinal":21,"kind":"text","jp":"蝋燭を消す。","en":"I blew out the candle.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:901519","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4011:00021","en":"I put out the candle,","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0270:00000724:text","row":36765,"ordinal":22,"kind":"text","jp":"窓際に。","en":"Went to the window.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:901520","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4011:00022","en":"and go to the window,","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0270:00000744:text","row":36766,"ordinal":23,"kind":"text","jp":"外を見る。","en":"Looked outside.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:901521","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4011:00023","en":"to look outside.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0270:00000837:text","row":36767,"ordinal":24,"kind":"text","jp":"家の前、道路を誰かが歩いていた。","en":"Someone was walking down the road in front of the house.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:901522","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4011:00024","en":"Someone is walking in front of the house, in the street.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0270:0000086f:text","row":36768,"ordinal":25,"kind":"text","jp":"……霧。","en":"...Kiri.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:901523","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4011:00025","en":"...Kiri.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0270:0000088f:text","row":36769,"ordinal":26,"kind":"text","jp":"荷物を抱えている。","en":"She was carrying luggage.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:901524","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4011:00026","en":"Holding a bag.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0270:000008b9:text","row":36770,"ordinal":27,"kind":"text","jp":"まあ、関与すべきことじゃないな。","en":"Not my concern.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:901525","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4011:00027","en":"Well, I ought not be involved.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0270:000009c2:text","row":36771,"ordinal":28,"kind":"text","jp":"机に戻る。","en":"I went back to the desk.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:901526","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4011:00028","en":"I return to the desk,","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0270:000009e4:text","row":36772,"ordinal":29,"kind":"text","jp":"ペンを取る。","en":"Picked up my pen.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:901527","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4011:00029","en":"and pick up the pen.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]}]}
